+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No decision on a transport compression codec is currently recorded for this project; the project's recorded decisions cover other areas (such as wire format, TLS backend, password hashing, caching, versioning, and licensing), but none specify a compression codec for transport, so no codec is documented here.
